<mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nSo, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"295\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D437 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is <em>not</em> closed under scalar multiplication.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Statement III is false, while statement IV is true. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"296\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D437 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is <em>not</em> a subspace because it's not closed under addition and scalar multiplication.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"IV only.\" </p>\n</div></div>",
